    "ciesin:purpose": "The GRID3 COD - Schools v1.0 dataset consists of school spatial data points with names and attributes in the following provinces of the Democratic Republic of the Congo (COD): Haut-Katanga, Kasaï, Kasaï-Oriental, Kinshasa, and Lomami.",
